# Boros Charm's third mode with Llanowar Elves as the target: Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt and the Elves die, so the Charm's only
# target is illegal as it would resolve and it does nothing (CR 608.2b) - it still goes to the graveyard, and nothing else gets
# double strike (the Moxen that paid for it have no keywords).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Llanowar Elves
Boros Charm
Mountain
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

